#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:7
#: 77962569fd38498e949fc953bfe92821 8aead506123f4bb8b2283dad6ca00616
#: b6033c7d0f80423483597855d2255a76 b7678d8ab7934b44863e4b09283983af
#: e8d70b08a67247e08c80c341fd53e16c
msgid ""
"The `Hondex HE-8S <https://www.honda-"
"el.co.jp/product/marine/lineup/gps_plotter_fishfinder/he-8s>`__ is an "
"echosounder (aka underwater sonar) with a 100m range, built-in GPS and NMEA "
"output that can be consumed by ArduPilot.  Other Hondex sonar may also work "
"but this has not yet been confirmed."
msgstr ""
"`Hondex HE-8S <https://www.honda-"
"el.co.jp/product/marine/lineup/gps_plotter_fishfinder/he-8s>`__ 是一款带有 100m "
"量程、内置 GPS 和 NMEA 输出的回声探测仪（水下声呐），可供 ArduPilot 使用。其他 Hondex 声呐也可能兼容，但尚未确认。"

